}}.\n$$\n\nRecall that $∝$ means \"is proportional to.\"\n\n- Finally, we want to replace the proportionality symbol with an equality symbol. Let $k$ be a positive constant. Since the temperature *decreases* with time, our derivative should be *negative*. Therefore, we can rewrite our proportionality statement as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}T}{\\text{d}t}=-\\frac{k}{{T}^{3}}.\n$$" 13194139534567 true] [17592186295909 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295910 13194139534567 true] [17592186295909 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295911 13194139534567 true] [17592186295909 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295912 13194139534567 true] [17592186295909 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295913 13194139534567 true] [17592186295909 1000 #edb/ref 17592186295914 13194139534567 true] [17592186295909 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534567 true] [17592186295909 1041 "selection" 13194139534567 true] [17592186295909 1104 #edb/ref 17592186295912 13194139534567 true] [17592186295909 1110 #uuid "b73c3167-d9bd-5f62-9aac-daf335b92dfd" 13194139534567 true] [17592186295910 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}T}{\\text{d}t}=k{T}^{3},\\,\\,k>0" 13194139534567 true] [17592186295910 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534567 true] [17592186295910 1111 #uuid "986154db-dfac-5a07-82eb-311209aa0418" 13194139534567 true] [17592186295911 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}T}{\\text{d}t}=k\\sqrt[3]{T},\\,\\,k>0" 13194139534567 true] [17592186295911 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534567 true] [17592186295911 1111 #uuid "d276e2bc-ab90-53f5-a791-7402cee1af46" 13194139534567 true] [17592186295912 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}T}{\\text{d}t}=-\\frac{k}{{T}^{3}},\\,\\,k>0" 13194139534567 true] [17592186295912 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534567 true] [17592186295912 1111 #uuid "c0a98ea7-6b9a-5569-94ba-43f3cdb94373" 13194139534567 true] [17592186295913 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}T}{\\text{d}t}=-k{T}^{3},\\,\\,k>0" 13194139534567 true] [17592186295913 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534567 true] [17592186295913 1111 #uuid "d710dcda-1285-5da2-a72a-eeb9cade0226" 1319413953456